OL,3,GNEWSALegal bid to stop dementia
OL,4,Apatient's deportation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe daughter of a man facing
OL,7,Fdeportation from Sweden said a
OL,8,Flast-minute injunction has been
OL,9,Fsubmitted in an attempt to pause the
OL,10,Fprocess.
OL,12,FThe Swedish authorities said they
OL,13,Fwanted George Mason, originally from
OL,14,FHinckley in Leicestershire, to leave
OL,15,Fthe country by midnight on Thursday.
OL,17,FHis daughter, Michelle Torossian, said
OL,18,Fthe family's lawyer had filed a legal
OL,19,Fchallenge on Thursday morning to pause
OL,20,Fthe deportation order.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
