OL,3,GNEWSALegal bid to stop dementia
OL,4,Apatient's deportation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the Swedish
OL,7,FMigrations Agency said: "We can confirm
OL,8,Freceipt of a case of an impediments to
OL,9,Fenforcement which the agency now will
OL,10,Fprocess."
